 const DEFAULT_LOG='[ADDED]\nIn-VR F8 settings menu, saved automatically\nPhysical sword hits on enemies, guard pose blocking\nHidden blade: flick your wrist to extend or retract\nHidden-blade stealth kills on unaware targets\nGrab and shove enemies with your hands\nTracked-hand ledge climbing\nLive finger animation\nComfort vignette, smooth and snap turning\nHand and head wall collision\nSwappable sword models, including the Sword of Eden\nLooser, freer stick movement and turning\n[COMING NEXT]\nWeather and a day and night cycle\nFully working modded weapons\nFirst-person play as Desmond, outside the Animus\n';
